				"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] High-end 3D CG product commercial, cinematic, 16:9. A wide shot reveals an endless black digital grid, with a sleek white computer mouse standing alone at the center as the main subject. During the first second, the camera rapidly pushes toward the mouse as its left button clicks by itself and sends a bright cyan energy pulse across the grid. From 1.00 to 3.00 seconds, the ground transforms into a glowing circuit-board racetrack while the mouse smoothly unfolds into a miniature futuristic racing car, preserving the recognizable mouse silhouette: the left and right buttons become aerodynamic body panels, and the scroll wheel becomes a luminous central turbine. From 3.00 to 5.00 seconds, the transformed mouse launches forward at extreme speed. The camera tracks beside it with large amplitude at fast speed as it races across the circuit, leaving a brilliant arrow-cursor-shaped light trail behind it. At the final moment, the camera arcs around the speeding mouse car as it surges toward the horizon, with sparks and cyan light particles sweeping past the lens.\n\noverall_soundscape: A crisp mouse click triggers a deep electronic pulse, followed by precise mechanical transformation sounds, a rising turbine whine, rapid acceleration, rushing air, and electrical sparks.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A fast electronic rhythm begins with one heavy impact, then builds with sharp synthesizer pulses and ends on a powerful bass hit."
